e likely or severe, else \"negative\" (used only for \"drives\"); \"affects_id\": the id of the goal or an outcome the risk would hurt; \"direction\": \"negative\" when the risk lowers it, \"positive\" when it raises it; \"relies_on\": what the option relies on, 12 words or fewer, starting with a verb or noun (e.g. \"filling both roles quickly\"); \"watch_for\": the early sign, 8 words or fewer}.\nA \"relies_on\" risk must name one option: shared preconditions cannot be applied yet and will be refused. It stays on the model with no links and is left out of the Run until the model can apply it to that option alone.\nThe goal: {\"id\":\"monthly_recurring_revenue\",\"label\":\"monthly recurring revenue\"}.\nGoal and outcomes (affects_id): [{\"id\":\"monthly_recurring_revenue\",\"label\":\"monthly recurring revenue\"},{\"id\":\"starter_tier_monthly_recurring_revenue\",\"label\":\"Starter tier monthly recurring revenue\"},{\"id\":\"monthly_starter_support_cost\",\"label\":\"Monthly starter support cost\"}].\nThe user's options and the factors each one changes: [{\"id\":\"launch_starter_tier\",\"label\":\"Launch starter tier\",\"changes\":[{\"id\":\"starter_tier_available\",\"label\":\"Starter tier available\"},{\"id\":\"starter_tier_monthly_price\",\"label\":\"Starter tier monthly price\"},{\"id\":\"new_starter_subscribers\",\"label\":\"New starter subscribers\"}]},{\"id\":\"raise_prices_10\",\"label\":\"Raise prices 10%\",\"changes\":[{\"id\":\"price_change_from_current_price\",\"label\":\"Price change from current price\"}]}].\nAll factors: [{\"id\":\"price_change_from_current_price\",\"label\":\"Price change from current price\"},{\"id\":\"existing_customers\",\"label\":\"Existing customers\"},{\"id\":\"starter_tier_available\",\"label\":\"Starter tier available\"},{\"id\":\"starter_tier_monthly_price\",\"label\":\"Starter tier monthly price\"},{\"id\":\"new_starter_subscribers\",\"label\":\"New starter subscribers\"},{\"id\":\"starter_support_cost_per_subscriber\",\"